    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SARAH: What is that?!\nJUNO: The meat-grinder!\nBETH: Who names these things?!\nSARAH: I don’t know if I’m ready for this yet.",
      "SARAH: Alright!\nBETH: Alright?!\nJUNO: ALRIGHT!!! Come on! Paddle!\nJUNO: Keep paddling!",
      "BETH: Its mud, blood and beer...\nBETH: We don’t have to do this you know. We can turn back, stay in town, get wasted and go to a barn dance.\nSARAH: Now that is frightening.\nBETH: My kind of town.",
      "JUNO: Sarah! Beth!\nSARAH: Juno.\nJUNO: Everything’s going to be fine. Better, it’s going to be great - go on in, Rebecca and Sam can’t wait to see you.\nBETH: She’s here. I wouldn’t push it any further than that.",
      "REBECCA: It’s so good to see you. So good.\nSAM: Beth! Sarah!\nSARAH: Sam. Thank you for your letter, it meant a lot to me.\nSAM: I’m sorry I couldn’t be there. Mid- terms..."
    ]
